  "description": "Introducing the Reid eTrail 1, a trail-blazing electric mountain bike engineered to elevate your off-road adventures to new heights. With its powerful motor, integrated battery, and rugged design, this eBike is ready to tackle any terrain with ease, offering an exhilarating ride that pushes boundaries and redefines what's possible.\nAt the core of the eTrail 1 is its Reid alloy MTB frame, meticulously crafted to seamlessly accommodate the integrated battery, ensuring a sleek and streamlined appearance while maintaining the bike's durability and agility on the trail.\nEquipped with a Bafang 250W rear hub motor and an advanced 11.6Ah battery the eTrail 1 delivers smooth and responsive electric assistance when you need it most. Whether you're climbing steep inclines or navigating technical descents, this eBike provides the extra power and torque to conquer any challenge with confidence.\nPaired with the SR Suntour XCM32 ATB fork with 100mm of travel, the eTrail 1 absorbs bumps and rough terrain with ease, ensuring a smooth and controlled ride over even the most rugged trails. Combined with Reid double-wall alloy rims and Kenda 29x2.35\" tires, you'll experience enhanced traction and stability, allowing you to confidently tackle any obstacle in your path.Shift gears effortlessly with the Shimano 9-speed shifter and rear derailleur, while Tektro hydro disc brakes deliver reliable stopping power in all conditions, providing you with the control and confidence to navigate challenging terrain with precision.With its LCD handlebar-mounted display, you can easily monitor key ride metrics such as speed, distance, battery level, and more, ensuring you stay informed and in control throughout your journey.\nSo, whether you're exploring winding forest trails, conquering rugged mountain paths, or simply seeking adventure off the beaten track, the Reid eTrail 1 is your ultimate companion for electrified off-road exploration. Experience the thrill of trail riding like never before and unlock new adventures with the power of electric assistance at your fingertips.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
